<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S5.SS3.SSS2" title="In V-C RQ3: Model Size ‣ V Results ‣ Evaluating Large Language Models for Functional and Maintainable Code in Industrial Settings: A Case Study at ASML" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">V-C</span>2 </span>Execution-based metrics</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S6" title="In Evaluating Large Language Models for Functional and Maintainable Code in Industrial Settings: A Case Study at ASML" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">VI </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Discussion</span></span></a>
