<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S6.SS2" title="In VI Discussion ‣ Evaluating Large Language Models for Functional and Maintainable Code in Industrial Settings: A Case Study at ASML" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">VI-B</span> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Generic versus Code-Specific LLMs</span></span></a></li>
